# Fresh NEWWORLD.ZEN with a content set: our harbour barrel and crate break under the native
# one-handed attack. Without a fresh .fracture setup aborts: "needs intact cache-backed native prop".
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
movable on
living on
noise on
destruction on
overlay off
ui off
view full

destruction2 setup barrel 1h
wait 600
shot own-barrel-before
wait 100
rec own-barrel-1h
destruction2 attack
wait 1200
destruction2 checkpoint
shot own-barrel-after
wait 100
stop

destruction2 setup crate 1h
wait 600
shot own-crate-before
wait 100
rec own-crate-1h
destruction2 attack
wait 1200
destruction2 checkpoint
shot own-crate-after
wait 100
stop
census
wait 100
